      <p begin="00:20.700" end="00:22.960" ttm:agent="v1">Girl you got me</p>
      <p begin="00:22.960" end="00:24.730" ttm:agent="v1">Hypnotic</p>
      <p begin="00:24.730" end="00:27.570" ttm:agent="v1">She not a good girl, nah</p>
      <p begin="00:27.570" end="00:29.070" ttm:agent="v1">She naughty</p>
      <p begin="00:28.530" end="00:35.350" ttm:agent="v1">It's just me and you in this club</p>
      <p begin="00:35.350" end="00:40.750" ttm:agent="v1">No one matter to me except for us</p>
      <p begin="00:40.750" end="00:42.280" ttm:agent="v1">Us, us, us, us</p>
      <p begin="00:42.280" end="00:47.870" ttm:agent="v1">Girl if you ain't notice, this my world</p>
      <p begin="00:47.870" end="00:52.360" ttm:agent="v1">There's still a lot you got to learn</p>
      <p begin="00:52.360" end="00:54.070" ttm:agent="v1">What's mine is hers</p>
      <p begin="00:54.070" end="00:57.160" ttm:agent="v1">Everything I got I worked my ass off I deserve it</p>
      <p begin="00:57.160" end="00:58.920" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch I'm not your fucking buddy</p>
      <p begin="00:58.920" end="01:00.910" ttm:agent="v1">She like &quot;I think I recognize you&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:00.910" end="01:02.850" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch I ain't nobody</p>
      <p begin="01:02.850" end="01:04.540" ttm:agent="v1">You can keep all the shit that you wearing</p>
      <p begin="01:04.540" end="01:06.040" ttm:agent="v1">We already know it's fake</p>
      <p begin="01:05.580" end="01:07.080" ttm:agent="v1">Ain't nobody impressed by the shit that you playing</p>
      <p begin="01:07.060" end="01:09.390" ttm:agent="v1">How the hatin' on me, but look like they lame?</p>
      <p begin="01:09.390" end="01:11.620" ttm:agent="v1">How they acting like that and they don't got a name?</p>
      <p begin="01:11.620" end="01:18.080" ttm:agent="v1">Order what you want, put it all on my tab</p>
      <p begin="01:18.080" end="01:19.580" ttm:agent="v1">Shots!</p>
